  "answer": "Call 911 now. Your child is floppy and drowsy after a seizure with fever, and that needs emergency care. While you wait, lay them on their side on a safe surface, put nothing in their mouth, and stay with them.",
  "triage": "Call 911 now - don't wait for 811, which is for non-emergencies. Tell them how long the seizure lasted. Tell 911 right away if breathing is hard, lips look blue, or another seizure starts.",
